x(M,"Fear vs. love",MW,"Fear and love can't share the same room:\n\n\"{q}\"\n— 1 John 4:18\n\nIf your faith is mostly fear, you haven't met the love yet.",[("There is no fear in love. Perfect love drives out fear.","1-Johannes:4:18")],None),
